Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unexpected. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I made a mistake in assuming\Nit would have been long dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you screwed up the\Ndelivery you were supposed to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you're the one who\Nasked him to deliver this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm just a hired hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're the one who did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, that's all on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, I didn't\Nknow it was so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could not care less about\Nwhatever the shipment was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My business is with the little\None standing behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, it's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to locate it and bring it back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sure is mighty generous of you\Nto come all this way to help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that kid is worth more to\Nme than you could even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck did that come from, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll warn you not to get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, you mind handing the\Nlittle fella over to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are still talking about Rolo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:02:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's worth some real money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, his carcass at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want his carcass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I could bring it back alive\Nand let my client have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the kid would be nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm doing\Nthem a favor, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't understand\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both Noor and that man are moving\Nso fast. I can't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, you are not\Nto leave my side, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you're kind of\Na weird one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.41,0:03:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're slowing me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'll just have to lop your\Nhead right off, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one strike with that tiny\Nblade, it's ridiculously strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like that cow I fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe even stronger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can do is avoid him\Non my intuition alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:05:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting him while protecting Rolo\Nis going to wear me down eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friend, you are irritating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The intensity is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This situation is\Ntreacherous, so stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we get too close, we\Ncould be swept up in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no mistaking who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is the Dead Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.89,0:05:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dead Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Former S-Rank adventurer, Dead Man Zadu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead Man Zadu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that you were supposed to be\Nhelping out with the guards today, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was, and I came across\Nthis while doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're documents from an unsolved case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is written here,\Nintended target is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why do we act as if it's still ongoing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:06:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that problem is over and done with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.27,0:06:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officially, the target is\Nalready considered dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officially?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dandog speaks of Dead Man Zadu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At an incredibly young age, he\Nbecame an S-Rank adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then proceeded to become\Na target for other S-Ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is officially a human S-Rank target.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a great deal of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to take a guy\Nlike him down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would strongly recommend\Nnot fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's a much smarter move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so bad that he\Nscares the instructors?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see those documents you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zadu keeps defeating everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to send more\Npeople just to get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fail to see any benefit in us going to\Nbattle with that can of worms right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he managed to master the complexities\Nof the ancient art of dwarven alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:07:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at the tender age of 13, he had\Nalready earned the name Dragonslayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the age of 13?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean he was better than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His abilities continued to\Nbe recognized after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as his reputation spread to foreign lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had become the very\Napex of all adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way that you're talking\Nabout this guy makes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him seem like he's the\Nperfect fairy tale hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did such an accomplished\Nperson become a target?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite all his natural skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he did not always use his abundance of\Ntalents and techniques for the right things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just as written there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,36 members of a merchant family\Nof Sorenza were all murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used his skills to\Nkill ordinary people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some in the guild association suggested he\Nbe stripped of his adventurer's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but all the contributions he has made to\Nthe guild were seen as far too significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took down a disaster-level\Nthreat of a monster all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.77,0:07:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because the opinion of how to deal\Nwith Zadu was so greatly divided,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the matter was thus put\Non an indefinite hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man accepts any and every commission\Nwithout any form of discrimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that is, if the price is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morals, social etiquette,\Nhistory, or precedence,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they are all completely\Nmeaningless to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The examples are vast and disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wiped out an entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As his client requested, he destroyed\Ntheir entire army all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then murdered the\Nwhole of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was as if he had merely\Nstepped on an anthill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before long, people began to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like he had absolutely no concept\Nof what is good and what is evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zadu once had a massive\Nbounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And was challenged by\Nmultitudes of adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even as the reward\Ngrew higher and higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.19,0:09:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only ended in a mountain of corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to prevent any\Nmore meaningless casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guild announced\Npublicly that he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now he's beyond redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you just destroy\Nmost of my collection?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I broke them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's kind of your fault for just\Nattacking us out of nowhere, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I am not expecting an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can understand Mithril, but Aurichalcum\Nand Dragontusk don't break that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both extremely durable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.37,0:09:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can pay you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you're a pretty\Nweird guy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.27,0:09:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And maybe even weirder is that big sword\Nyou have a weird guy with a weird sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever, I'll\Njust play it safe then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And use this baby instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.65,0:10:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear God, his one sword splits\Napart into scores of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the blink of an eye,\Nhundreds of lives are taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A deadly weapon he\Ntransmuted by his own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bring you the Silver Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy as many of them as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't matter I can make\Nas many of them as I want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroying as many of them\Nas you like it won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make as many of them as I want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor I knew I\Ncouldn't handle all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has conjured countless\Nsilver crosses at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:10:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must compose myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mission is to make sure Lady\NLindberg makes it safely into exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to calmly determine my priorities\Nand take stock of what I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, may I have your permission\Nto leave you and assist in the battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.61,0:11:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Countering is the best I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too late for these!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.53,0:11:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My duty as Divine Shield is to\Nprotect Lady Lindbergh at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is precisely why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not, under any\Ncircumstance, let this man die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait, I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ines, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shield of light\Nis almost like a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it doesn't seem\Nlike any will hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his silver blades are\Nstill slipping through somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing will change if we\Ncontinue fighting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will focus on defense\Nfor the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can take this guy out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a swarm of blades flying around\Nlike a living creature. But hey, I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember hitting a bird once that was
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,faster than this oh the fang of that frog
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe this will work in this can you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it hmm yeah on my signal remove only
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the shields that are right in front of\Nme are you sure this is going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, I don't know, but\Nwe're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The silver crosses are shattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he throw the Black Death\NDragon's nails and fangs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I've got plenty of ammo,\Nso I'll just keep throwing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.51,0:13:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've taken out a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You kind of surprised me that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.71,0:13:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could say the same about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you block that one so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, this one's adamantite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world did you manage\Nto break something so resilient?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you were all coming at me and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said before, I don't need an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I will have to make\Nup for what I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.41,0:14:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please stop it with\Nall the surprise attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's that weird\Nsword being weird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are truly made for one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How have you been able to see every single
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of my attacks and\Nthen use it to counter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like there must be much more\Nto it than such a blasé answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna try it again, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pain in the ass to recover Mithril
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after it gets shattered\Nall over the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I think I'll close up shop for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, you're leaving\Nnow, right? Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I heard there's going to be a\Nflashy celebration in the royal capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:15:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I guess I'll probably have\Nto give up going to that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean there's a\Ncelebration in the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know all the details, but it\Nsounds like it'll be a real hootenanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, it's been a swell time,\Nbut I guess I'll just pack it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be seeing ya, you big weirdo. Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how did you get to be so weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep saying that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my line of work, I've met a lot\Nof strange people along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but among them all, I can say\Nyou're exceptionally screwy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky, demon folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have made a good haul\Nbringing you back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please just give it a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't really have any fun with\Nthis guy around now, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.31,0:16:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Zadu say that there would be some\Nsort of celebration in the royal capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two want to check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it'll be quite the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, in that case, why don't we\Ngo back and hang out for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really not that far from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.95,0:16:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we can't take\NRolo all the way to Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it'll take us way\Ntoo long to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Zornor, I'm not sure that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you getting cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, did you say you all\Ncame from the royal capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we can't all go on our journey,\NI thought we could just go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Rolo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not want to come\Nwith us or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:17:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I overheard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The biggest of them is\Ngoing to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said to be strong enough\Nto wipe out the entire city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been planning\Nsomething for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said it'll make the Black\NDeath Dragon look like nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, wipe out the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ines, we need to get back to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This situation appears more\Nurgent than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.73,0:17:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot agree to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Rain told me that I need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.01,0:17:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told you that if anything happens in\Nthe capital, to escape with me to Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.41,0:17:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what he told you to do, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm his little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how my brother\Nthinks when it comes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, I couldn't live with\Nbeing the only one who ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, somebody\Nneeds to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must know about\Nthe danger they're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, m 'lady! Inez, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the story of the demon folk\Nand how they lost their homeland, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we try to escape now, we will only\Nend up with the same fate as they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall all go to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.45,0:18:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, Lady Lindbergh, do not,\Nunder any circumstances, leave my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for doing this, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really don't want to go there with\Nus, probably best if we part ways here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because whoever is bringing that dragon,\Nwe can be sure they must be demon folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being demon folk sounds like hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure knowing this boy's\Nupbringing has greatly pained Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's such a big-hearted person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least compared to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure wish I could have had\Nmyself a plate of that poison frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it would be a\Nlie to say I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if Instructor Noor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who fought off both a black death dragon\Nand the legendary dead man Zadu is with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then maybe we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rolo, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the wild horses over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.81,0:19:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As princess of Clay's kingdom,\Nmy duty is to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must bring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man who jumped straight\Nout of an epic hero's tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:19:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must go back to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it costs me my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get there as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting in, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most of the citizens in the old city\Ndistrict have been successfully evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the efforts of the sovereign six have paid
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off and I believe they\Nhave fended off the.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy's ambush right there should\Nstill be another wave coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the secret corps have been conducting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A desperate search for the enemy sir,\Nbut there has been no sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're coming they will do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our forces have all been scattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for us\Nto exhaust ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're smart, they should\Nbe setting up for the next big
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wave. Probably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is, we cannot even\Nfathom exactly what the next
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.39,0:21:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wave will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.45,0:21:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor from what direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The north?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The south?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to The hunter\Ncorps' latest report,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there have been no\Nconfirmed sightings of any.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flying beast
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh you see that something
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is hovering up there\Njust above the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.29,0:21:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cannot be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a black dragon!
